cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "lex-articles, per-provision consolidated Luxembourg and EU law"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Hajji
    given-names: Soufien
repository-code: "https://github.com/SFHAJJI/lex-articles"
url: "https://law.soufien.lu"
abstract: >-
  Point-in-time consolidated legislation of Luxembourg (Legilux) and the European Union
  (EUR-Lex/Cellar), derived deterministically into one Markdown+JSON record per provision
  per version. Every provision carries a SHA-256 hash chained to the verbatim publisher
  bytes it was derived from, publisher-minted anchors, validity intervals, and per-article
  history (including renumbering events). Immutable extraction profiles (akn-lu/1,
  xhtml-eu/1, fmx4-eu/1) make every derivation reproducible.
keywords:
  - legal-data
  - point-in-time
  - consolidated-legislation
  - luxembourg
  - european-union
  - akoma-ntoso
  - formex
  - open-data
license: CC-BY-4.0
